  "text_content": "Bola went to the market with her grandma. There were red tomatoes, yellow mangoes and green beans on every table. Grandma bought a bag of rice and some fish. Bola carried the bag, but it was too heavy. A kind man saw her and smiled. He put the rice on his cart and walked with them. At the gate of their house, Grandma thanked him. She gave him some mangoes to say thank you. Bola waved as he went away.",
